    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ballbastic! is a game created to scratch the itch of hardcore gamers with an interest in games that are easy to learn but difficult to master.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your rolling skills against 150 levels across Novice, Journeyman, Expert, and Marathon Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how fast you can beat a difficulty level when you select Play for Time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how far you can get on a single life in Survival Mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shake up your experience with Randomizer Mode after beating every level once.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to utilize your environment with trampolines, rockets, teleporters, speeders, slowers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through harder-to-reach warps to skip levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six different worlds, all with their own theme, from the simple mountains to the mind-boggling dreamscape. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instantaneous gameplay</strong>. No instant replays when you die or score calculations when you pass a level--just keep on going!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring Brian Matt as the announcer; returning to form from narrating Super Monkey Ball games in the early 2000s.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/e5f909c0e0a1618c7131979fea75e3b6.avif?t=1738378431\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of cosmetic skins to unlock that prove what you are capable of doing!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/53e2f66f93038ab77aed0a1674e1edd8.avif?t=1738378431\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ballbastic! is a game created to scratch the itch of hardcore gamers with an interest in games that are easy to learn but difficult to master.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your rolling skills against 150 levels across Novice, Journeyman, Expert, and Marathon Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how fast you can beat a difficulty level when you select Play for Time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See how far you can get on a single life in Survival Mode!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shake up your experience with Randomizer Mode after beating every level once.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to utilize your environment with trampolines, rockets, teleporters, speeders, slowers, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through harder-to-reach warps to skip levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six different worlds, all with their own theme, from the simple mountains to the mind-boggling dreamscape. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instantaneous gameplay</strong>. No instant replays when you die or score calculations when you pass a level--just keep on going!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring Brian Matt as the announcer; returning to form from narrating Super Monkey Ball games in the early 2000s.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/e5f909c0e0a1618c7131979fea75e3b6.avif?t=1738378431\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of cosmetic skins to unlock that prove what you are capable of doing!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428170/extras/53e2f66f93038ab77aed0a1674e1edd8.avif?t=1738378431\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An arcade-style passion project based off similar ball-rolling games from the early 2000s. Guide the ball to the goal within the time limit, and be sure not to fall off!",
